comments_data.body:
updated @IanMayo 
Notes: I see you change the way we store the feedback item likes
```
message.details.collaboration.feedback.push(feedbackItem)
```
So I think we don't need to make a change in the `helpers/changers` because we already handle it in
```
return {
    ...message,
    details: {
      ...message.details,
      collaboration: {
        ...message.details.collaboration, // <== the 'message.details.collaboration.feedback' in here
        status: CollaborativeMessageStates.DocumentPending,
        owner: undefined
      }
    }
  }
```
